n>\n\n        <section class=\"section\">\n            <h2>凉菜</h2>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-name\">酱鸭胸肉</div><div class=\"price\">¥45</div></div>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-name\">拌海带丝</div><div class=\"price\">¥28</div></div>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-name\">杭帮酱菜</div><div class=\"price\">¥32</div></div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"section\">\n            <h2>汤羹</h2>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-name\">东坡肉汤</div><div class=\"price\">¥38</div></div>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-name\">龙井虾仁汤</div><div class=\"price\">¥42</div></div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"section\">\n            <h2>主食</h2>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-name\">杭三鲜面</div><div class=\"price\">¥30</div></div>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-name\">西湖莼菜粥</div><div class=\"price\">¥26</div></div>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-name\">酱爆虾仁炒饭</div><div class=\"price\">¥35</div></div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"section\">\n            <h2>甜点 & 饮品</h2>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-name\">西湖藕粉圆子</div><div class=\"price\">¥22</div></div>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-name\">龙井茶</div><div class=\"price\">¥15</div></div>\n            <div class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-name\">桂花酒酿圆子</div><div class=\"price\">¥28</div></div>\n        </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        © 2026 家味餐厅 | 杭州市西湖区文一路88号 | 电话：0571-12345678\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\n===== FILE: about.html =====\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>家味餐厅 - 关于我们</title>\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n    <style>\n        body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#fff;color:#333;}\n        header{background:#d33;color:#fff;padding:15px 20px;}\n        header h1{margin:0;font-size:1.8rem;}\n        nav a{margin-right:12px;color:#fff;}\n        .content{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:30px 20px;}\n        .content h2{color:#d33;margin-top:30px;}\n        .content p{line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:15px;}\n        .footer{background:#222;color:#ccc;padding:15px;text-align:center;font-size:0.9rem;}\n        @media(max-width:600px){\n            .content{padding:20px 10px;}\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header>\n        <h1>家味餐厅 - 关于我们</h1>\n        <nav>\n            <a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n            <a href=\"menu.html\">菜单</a>\n            <a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a>\n            <a href=\"reservation.html\">预订座位</a>\n        </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n        <h2>我们的故事</h2>\n        <p>家味餐厅的创始人陈阿姨来自浙江温州，一个热爱烹饪、喜欢把家常味道传递给每个人的普通家庭主妇。十年前，她随丈夫搬到杭州，在西湖旁租下这间小店，开始用自家厨房的手艺为邻里提供温暖的浙江菜。</p>\n        <p>“让每一位走进餐厅的客人，都能感受到‘回到家’的感觉”，这句口号成为了我们一直坚持的信念。我们坚持选用本地当季食材，保持传统烹饪技巧的同时，也在菜品中加入适度创新，让经典与时尚相得益彰。</p>\n\n        <h2>我们的理念</h2>\n        <p>① 食材新鲜：与杭州本地农贸市场、渔民直供合作，确保每一道菜的原料都来自当天采摘或捕捞。</p>\n        <p>② 传统工艺：保留浙江本帮菜的烹饪手法，如慢火炖、糖醋调味、酱汁熬制等。</p>\n        <p>③ 家庭氛围：店内装饰以木质家具、温暖灯光为主，提供舒适的就餐环境，适合家庭聚餐与朋友小聚。</p>\n\n        <h2>环境与设施</h2>\n        <p>餐厅拥有30个独立座位，设有儿童区、包间以及可容纳12人的大圆桌。免费Wi-Fi、充电插座以及无障碍通道让每位客人都能轻松用餐。</p>\n        <p>我们还提供外卖包装和节日礼盒，方便顾客把美味带回家。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        © 2026 家味餐厅 | 杭州市西湖区文一路88号 | 电话：0571-12345678\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\n===== FILE: reservation.html =====\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>家味餐厅 - 预订座位</title>\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n    <style>\n        body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f5f5f5;color:#333;}\n        header{background:#d33;color:#fff;padding:15px 20px;}\n        header h1{margin:0;font-size:1.8rem;}\n        nav a{margin-right:12px;color:#fff;}\n        .form-container{background:#fff;max-width:600px;margin:40px auto;padding:30px;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1);}\n        .form-container h2{color:#d33;margin-bottom:20px;}\n        .form-group{margin-bottom:15px;}\n        label{display:block;margin-bottom:5px;font-weight:bold;}\n        input, select, textarea{width:100%;padding:8px;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:4px;font-size:1rem;}\n        textarea{resize:vertical;height:80px;}\n        .submit-btn{background:#d33;color:#fff;border:none;padding:10px 20px;font-size:1rem;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;}\n        .submit-btn:hover{background:#b02;}\n        .footer{background:#222;color:#ccc;padding:15px;text-align:center;font-size:0.9rem;margin-top:40px;}\n        @media(max-width:600px){\n            .form-container{margin:20px;padding:20px;}\n        }\n    </style>\n    <script>\n        function validateForm(event){\n            var name=document.getElementById('name').value.trim();\n            var phone=document.getElementById('phone').value.trim();\n            if(!name||!phone){\n                alert('请填写姓名和电话！');\n                event.preventDefault();\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header>\n        <h1>家味餐厅 - 预订座位</h1>\n        <nav>\n            <a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n            <a href=\"menu.html\">菜单</a>\n            <a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a>\n            <a href=\"reservation.html\">预订座位</a>\n        </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"form-container\">\n        <h2>在线预订</h2>\n        <form onsubmit=\"validateForm(event)\">\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n                <label for=\"name\">姓名</label>\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" placeholder=\"请输入您的姓名\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n                <label for=\"phone\">联系电话</label>\n                <input type=\"tel\" id=\"phone\" name=\"phone\" placeholder=\"例：13800138000\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n                <label for=\"date\">用餐日期</label>\n                <input type=\"date\" id=\"date\" name=\"date\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n                <label for=\"time\">用餐时间</label>\n                <select id=\"time\" name=\"time\">\n                    <option value=\"11:30\">11:30</option>\n                    <option value=\"12:00\">12:00</option>\n                    <option value=\"12:30\">12:30</option>\n                    <option value=\"13:00\">13:00</option>\n                    <option value=\"18:00\">18:00</option>\n                    <option value=\"18:30\">18:30</option>\n                    <option value=\"19:00\">19:00</option>\n                    <option value=\"19:30\">19:30</option>\n                </select>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n                <label for=\"guests\">人数</label>\n                <input type=\"number\" id=\"guests\" name=\"guests\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" value=\"2\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n                <label for=\"notes\">特殊需求（可选）</label>\n                <textarea id=\"notes\" name=\"notes\" placeholder=\"如婴儿座椅、过敏信息等\"></textarea>\n            </div>\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"submit-btn\">提交预订</button>\n        </form>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        © 2026 家味餐厅 | 杭州市西湖区文一路88号 | 电话：0571-12345678\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n",
